n D, with several flagging a likely flip.\n\nCollins has raised over $22 million and retains the incumbency edge, but Jackson has outraised her and faces little outside opposition spending. National figures from both parties have campaigned in the state, and tariff politics loom over the contest. The race sits just on the Democratic side of the ledger, with genuine uncertainty about the final result.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.7341, "margin": 3.16}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.6906, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.626, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.6915, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.5751, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.6364, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.6474, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.6668, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.6495, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.6328, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.6994, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.6388, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.6279, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.5727, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.6061, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.6059, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.6373, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.6384, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.6413, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.6281, "margin": 2.2}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.7044, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.6795, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.6677, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.6481, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-16", "p_dem": 0.64, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-17", "p_dem": 0.649, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-18", "p_dem": 0.6509, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-19", "p_dem": 0.6481, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10